      {
        "Id": "2db9cc02d44445f0b4ef51b65b0a93a6",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  place plans / sections on sheets, name the sheets, Run\nTags follow the SHEET NAME: 'COLUMN LAYOUT' -> column tags only, 'BEAM LAYOUT' -> beam tags, 'SLAB' -> slab tags + level, 'FOOTING' -> footings, 'WALL / BLOCK' -> walls.\nNo keyword: structural sheet (S / STR in number) -> columns + beams, architectural / ID sheet (A / AR / ID) -> walls.  Every plan gets grid + overall dimensions.\nEach plan tags ONLY its own level. Tags are measured and moved to a free spot - no clashes. Spacing follows each view scale.",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
